---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import portrait from "../assets/images/about-george.jpg";
import { about, site } from "../data/content";
---

<section id="about" class="bg-stone-100">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-20 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 items-center">
    <div class="order-2 md:order-1 bg-paper p-8 sm:p-10">
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-ink">
        {about.headline}
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 font-display font-semibold text-lg text-ink">
        {about.subheadline}
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-ink/85">
        George recently left the tech industry after 30 memorable years, and he is now ready for some magic. As a Boston-based magician, he is dedicated to making parties as memorable and enjoyable as possible. George initially learned magic to entertain his son when his wife became pregnant, and he now loves seeing the awe-struck and entertained faces of his audience.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink/85">
        In addition to performing, George is a Founding Producer, Performer, and Emcee at <a
          href={about.bostonMagicLabUrl}
          class="text-brand-green underline decoration-brand-gold decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          >The Boston Magic Lab</a
        >.
      </p>

      <a
        href={site.instagramUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        aria-label="Instagram"
        class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center text-ink hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors"
      >
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="24"
          height="24"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5"></rect>
          <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path>
          <line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"></line>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
      <Image
        src={portrait}
        alt="George Madrid performing"
        widths={[400, 600, 900, 1200]}
        sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
